cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the Dianchi Water dataset or this benchmark code, please cite
  both the repository and the accompanying paper.
type: software
title: 'Dianchi Water: Dataset & Benchmark Code'
version: 1.0.0
authors:
