identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.23232257
    description: Archived version of this repository on Zenodo
abstract: >-
  Code release for the Dianchi Water benchmark: the executable eight-stage
  curation pipeline, natural-missingness workload generation, the mask-view
  augmentation (MAS) training protocol, and imputation/forecasting benchmark
  harnesses for 11 architectures on a curated surface-water-quality panel,
  with cross-dataset replication on Beijing Air Quality and ETTh1.
license: BSD-3-Clause
keywords:
  - time-series imputation
  - missing data
  - structured missingness
  - benchmark
  - water quality
  - environmental monitoring
